@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_ATENDENTE
@orderId = 1

### Abrir OS (inicia a saga: CreateBudget → billing-service)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Revisão geral de 10.000km",
  "clientPFId": 1,
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": 1, "parts": [{ "partId": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "partId": 2, "quantity": 1 }] }
  ]
}

### Listar OS ativas (prioridade de atendimento)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe da OS + resumo da saga
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Visão consolidada (REST síncrono no billing e no exec-prod)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Histórico de status + trilha da saga
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar OS (dispara compensações)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "reason": "Cliente desistiu do serviço" }

### Entregar veículo (FINALIZADA → ENTREGUE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
